  "ownership_scope": "Canonical admission (22 cases), concurrency (13) and restore_allocator (16) suites belong to leserpent-vm. Original assertions, storage fault injections, thread coordination and shared-core type/wire comparisons are unchanged apart from owner-qualified paths and formatting. All three targets require sqlite-journal because their acceptance includes durable storage.",
